    <string name="legal_1_title">1. Application Copyright</string>
    <string name="legal_1_body">Copyright © 2026 %1$s (%2$s). %3$s (%4$s) original application code, UI design, and branding are owned by the developer.</string>
    <string name="legal_2_title">2. Application License</string>
    <string name="legal_2_body">VD Player is provided for personal, lawful offline media management, playback, and authorized downloading. Redistribution or unauthorized repackaging of proprietary branding is prohibited.</string>
    <string name="legal_3_title">3. Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="legal_3_body">VD Player operates local-first. Downloads, gallery records, playback history, browser bookmarks/history, and AES-256-GCM vault files remain on your device. No personal media or vault keys are transmitted to developer servers. Network requests are made solely to URLs or custom HTTPS APIs you explicitly initiate.</string>
    <string name="legal_4_title">4. Terms and Conditions</string>
    <string name="legal_4_body">You are solely responsible for ensuring you possess legal rights or authorization before downloading, converting, or storing any third-party media. VD Player does not bypass DRM, authentication walls, or platform access controls.</string>
    <string name="legal_5_title">5. Third-Party Open Source Licenses</string>
    <string name="legal_6_title">6. Media Processing &amp; Scanning Library Licenses</string>
    <string name="legal_7_title">7. Download Usage Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="legal_7_body">Downloading copyrighted material without permission from the copyright holder may violate applicable laws and platform terms. Supported downloads are limited to direct HTTPS streams, open web media tags, and user-configured authorized endpoints.</string>
    <string name="legal_8_title">8. Intellectual Property Notice</string>
    <string name="legal_8_body">All third-party trademarks, open-source libraries, and media assets remain the intellectual property of their respective owners. VD Player makes no ownership claim over third-party software or user-downloaded media.</string>
